            <creation xml:id="creation_id6abc5dfe">
               <date isodate="1892" xml:id="date_cd4eb6a1">c. 1892</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_idcc9b363f">
               <p xml:id="idm66">According to a letter from Adolf Langsted which is enclosed in the manuscript, this song was meant for "Kristelig Kalender". The letter is undated and the manuscript likewise, indicating, that Hartmann never finished the song. In this letter Langsted mentions two works one  by Julius Bechgaard and one by Christian Barnekow, which were both published in 1892.</p>
